<InfoPage title="Privacy policy" description="How Trending Topic handles information when you use this website." canonical="https://trendingnews.vercel.app/privacy-policy">
  <p><strong>Last updated: October 8, 2026</strong></p>
  <p>This policy describes information that may be processed when you visit Trending Topic. The site currently does not require an account to browse topics or stories.</p>
  <h2>Information involved in using the site</h2>
  <p>When you use search, your search terms are included in the page address so the results can be displayed and shared. As with other websites, the hosting provider may process technical request information, such as browser and device details, IP address, and requested pages, to deliver and protect the service. How long that information is retained depends on the provider.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
  <p>The site’s current browsing features do not require an account. Your browser or hosting infrastructure may use technical storage or logs to operate the website. If analytics, advertising, or other optional tracking is added, this policy should be updated to describe it.</p>
  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>Topic and news pages may link to external publishers or services. Those websites have their own privacy practices, which we do not control. Review their policies before sharing information with them.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can choose not to use the search feature and can manage cookies through your browser settings. Browser settings may affect how some websites work.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, please use the contact details provided on our <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> page.</p>
</InfoPage>
